# A turn that traps, and the page after it

## Component App
State:
    Let n be 0.
    Let boom be 0.
Actions:
    To bad:
        Set n to 5.
        Set boom to item 9 of [1].
    To good:
        Set n to 3.
View:
    <main><p id="n">{n}</p><button id="b" on-click={bad}>x</button><button id="g" on-click={good}>y</button></main>

## Test: the page still answers after a trapping turn
    Mount App.
    Click "#b".
    Expect that the text of "#n" is equal to "0".
    Click "#g".
    Expect that the text of "#n" is equal to "3".
